{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他现在在乎的，是那条已经被认作同一件事的线索在细节暂时变少时还能不能留在注意里；他不再只靠不断增加的内容维持它，也没有因此要求立刻得到结论。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H4已经建立：在确认过连续性之后，后来增加的复杂细节可以先被当作同一件事的继续展开，而不必借复杂化逼出结论。\",\"bridge\":\"既然连续性已经在复杂化中经受过一次确认，他此刻就不必一遇到信息减少便重新证明“还是不是同一件事”；注意可以暂时从追逐细节，转成看这条线在缺少持续补充时是否仍能被保留下来。\",\"current\":\"因此这一小段的疏薄更像一次悬置：他仍牵着那件事，但暂时没有很多东西可追；之后重新出现较连续的运动，也只是让这份关注重新有了可跟随的内容，末尾的停驻并没有把它推成结论。\",\"without\":\"如果没有H4此前对连续性的确认，这里的细节骤减更容易首先被体验成线索可能散掉，需要重新抓住；现在则能够容许它短暂变稀，而不立刻把中断感当成关系已经改变。\"},\"used\":[\"H4\"],\"new_history\":[\"在已经确认一条线索能够承受复杂化之后，他也开始容许它在暂时缺少细节时继续存在；对他而言，“还能继续”不再要求每一刻都有新的内容来维持。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"H4改变了细节减少时的体验：不是泛泛地‘更深’，而是从需要持续辨认连续性，转为能够让已确认的线索在短暂稀薄中保持可返回；没有把织体重新变密解释为外部回应或关系进展。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "535e97fe-1787-4699-8524-134d2704e31a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214846862763Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.031, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:49:13.896055+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2fd278b01aaf5a1a93bed11859b53020a02f1874aef200e750c36568821a3fd3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214846862763Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "63a5ad4416d48df93e9eef36edca8c8032062458c4f1e480a15fce8ca96c0d13"}}}
